(text "R640 uses the same rail as SARADC_AVDD_1V8.\nNo button: HIGH selects normal boot.\nHold RECOVERY during startup/reset to request Loader.\nRelease after the PC recognizes the USB device.\nDo not attach an external powered signal to TP640.\n\nUnused internal ADC channels are disconnected.\nPractical analog expansion will use a protected external ADC.\nMaskROM fallback remains on eMMC D0/GND service pads." (at 17.78 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "477823cf-3cc0-5a3d-a2b2-5ace26e9b53d"))
