(text "R641 limits discharge of existing reset capacitors.\nReset does not remove power from the board.\nPMIC RESETB is open drain; keep reset pull-up R494." (at 246.38 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4d76277b-7cd9-5c84-9a18-0d64054b7254"))
(text "R642 limits discharge of C485. Internal pull-up is 17k.\nPress >=500ms to start when PMIC input is valid.\nLong-press behavior depends on RK809 register settings;\nprovision and test shutdown/restart behavior explicitly.\nThis button does not solve brownout auto-restart." (at 246.38 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f7032ffe-ca20-546b-a0af-f027aced117d"))
(text "Three identical normally-open Alps switches. Physical contacts 1/2 map to logical pad1; 3/4 map to logical pad2.\nReserve finger access and label RECOVERY / RESET / POWER on final silkscreen.\nRockchip HW Guide V1.2 p69; RK809 V1.7 pp26–29. USB recovery electrical qualification and automatic restart remain unfinished." (at 15.24 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "64de92c8-52fa-5945-85c9-cd41f220e07f"))
)
